          "type": "question",
          "disabled": false,
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Can I use these bulbs in art galleries or high-end retail displays?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, our CRI 95+ collection is the preferred choice for galleries and boutique retail where colour precision is non-negotiable. The high fidelity ensures that products and paintings are viewed exactly as the artist or designer intended, with no artificial colour shifting.</p>"
          }
        }
